WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.876
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:06.214
We made it through the regional preliminaries
and were fired up for the final preliminaries.

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:08.717
But Nico-cchi left practice early.

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:09.509
When we followed her...

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:10.969
I'm her younger sister, Yazawa Cocoro.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:11.761
Sis!

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:14.097
Backup dancers.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.974
Nico-cchi had been lying to her siblings.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.976
We discovered a sad past.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:21.521
I shine brightest when the
nine of us are together.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.524
Far more than when I was alone.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:29.321
A door opened in Nico-cchi's heart, and
M's grew even more united than before!

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:31.823
The beach!

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.325
The beach!

00:00:34.075 --> 00:00:36.661
The beach!

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:40.081
That's enough. Stop shouting
my name so many times!

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:41.499
I'm not shouting at you.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.793
I'm talking about the ocean!

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.297
It's beautiful.

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:50.008
The water in Okinawa is a
different shade of blue.

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:53.219
- Let's all jump in together!
- Okay.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:56.014
All right. Here we go.

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:57.557
Ready, and...

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:02.854
Come on, Maki-chan and Kayo-chin!

00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:05.357
Just because Honoka and the
others are on a school trip

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:07.108
doesn't mean we have to
have play around, too.

00:01:07.108 --> 00:01:09.486
Yeah. Besides, it's already fall.

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:10.528
Who cares?

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:11.780
C'mon, let's swim!

00:01:12.113 --> 00:01:13.198
Ready, and...

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.700
Here we go!

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:24.250
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:31.841
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:44.270
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:49.776
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:54.864
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:01:54.864 --> 00:01:59.994
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:01:59.994 --> 00:02:05.500
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:11.381
seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can

00:02:11.381 --> 00:02:14.217
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:14.217 --> 00:02:19.806
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:24.602
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:24.602 --> 00:02:30.775
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:35.780
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:41.119
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:02:41.119 --> 00:02:47.834
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.717
#5 - A New Me

00:02:55.717 --> 00:02:57.177
It won't stop raining.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.179
It's almost time for practice.

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:02.056
Yeah, but it's just the four of us again today.

00:03:02.474 --> 00:03:04.100
I'm sick of this.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.852
I could say the same thing.

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:07.687
It can't be helped, Rin-chan.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:09.898
The second years are on a school trip,

00:03:09.898 --> 00:03:13.651
so Eli-chan and Nozomi-chan are handling
the student council while they're gone.

00:03:13.651 --> 00:03:14.360
That's right.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:18.531
I understand your lack of enthusiasm,
but we all have to do what we have to do.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:19.783
Going to the student council again?

00:03:19.783 --> 00:03:20.909
Yeah.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.620
There it is.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:28.625
She's excited about organizing things so that
it'll be easier to manage when they return.

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:31.544
What? We're the only ones practicing again!?

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:34.339
We have that event this weekend.

00:03:34.339 --> 00:03:37.467
It's the day after Honoka
and the others return.

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:43.264
We should confirm our formation, so that we
can get right to it once we're all back together.

00:03:43.264 --> 00:03:47.811
I can't believe we were asked
to sing at a fashion show.

00:03:47.811 --> 00:03:51.606
We must be sharing the stage with models.

00:03:51.606 --> 00:03:53.191
It makes me so nervous.

00:03:53.191 --> 00:03:56.110
Yeah. You two are fine, but...

00:03:58.822 --> 00:03:59.614
What?

00:03:59.614 --> 00:04:02.367
It's nothing to worry about.

00:04:02.367 --> 00:04:03.159
Bye.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:07.080
Honoka-chan and the others are focused
on searching for wild Okinawan sweets.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:10.542
I'm sure they've forgotten
all about the concert.

00:04:10.542 --> 00:04:12.544
You girls need to keep it together.

00:04:14.796 --> 00:04:17.090
What are wild Okinawan sweets?

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.675
Who knows?

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:22.136
Okinawa, huh?

00:04:22.136 --> 00:04:27.141
I bet they're having fun right now.

00:04:28.309 --> 00:04:31.396
Umi-chan, hurry up!

00:04:32.564 --> 00:04:34.357
Wait for me!

00:04:35.984 --> 00:04:39.320
Why is it raining!?

00:04:40.071 --> 00:04:42.282
They say the typhoon might hit us.

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:43.491
What?

00:04:43.491 --> 00:04:45.618
What about the beach?
The midsummer sun?

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:47.912
We'll have to give up on those.

00:04:47.912 --> 00:04:50.707
No way! This is a high school trip!

00:04:50.707 --> 00:04:53.126
It's a once in a lifetime experience!

00:04:53.126 --> 00:04:54.794
If that's how it's gonna be...

00:04:54.794 --> 00:05:00.675
- Go away... Go away... Go away...
- I don't think there's any point to doing that.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:02.135
Oh, right.

00:05:03.386 --> 00:05:07.640
- Go away... Go away...
- I don't think that's any different.

00:05:10.685 --> 00:05:11.936
It's Eli-chan.

00:05:11.936 --> 00:05:12.687
Hello?

00:05:12.687 --> 00:05:15.481
Honoka? How are you? Are you having fun?

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:16.441
Are you trying to upset me?

00:05:16.441 --> 00:05:17.984
Huh? Why?

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:20.695
Never mind. Anyway... What did you want?

00:05:20.695 --> 00:05:22.697
It's about this weekend's event.

00:05:22.697 --> 00:05:24.157
I wanted to talk to you about something.

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:26.034
Okay.

00:05:26.784 --> 00:05:27.702
I see.

00:05:28.286 --> 00:05:30.163
That might be a good idea.

00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:33.625
We need to decide who's doing it.

00:05:35.043 --> 00:05:37.378
I wonder who we should choose...

00:05:38.129 --> 00:05:40.590
Nozomi and I talked about it, and...

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:42.050
Yeah.

00:05:42.884 --> 00:05:46.804
What!? You want me to be the leader!?

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:52.185
Yes. We'll be more organized
with a temporary leader,

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:54.812
and it'll improve your practices.

00:05:55.396 --> 00:05:58.691
Of course, it would only be until Honoka
and the others return from their trip.

00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:00.151
B-But...

00:06:00.568 --> 00:06:04.447
We called and talked it over with the second
years, and this was the decision we reached.

00:06:04.447 --> 00:06:08.076
We all think you should do it.

00:06:08.076 --> 00:06:09.118
What do you two think?

00:06:09.118 --> 00:06:10.536
I think she's a good choice.

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:12.580
I also think Rin-chan's a good choice.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:16.250
H-Hold on. Why me?

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:19.087
Someone else would definitely be better.

00:06:19.087 --> 00:06:20.046
Like Eli-chan.

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:22.465
I have to help with the student council.

00:06:23.007 --> 00:06:27.971
Besides, considering the future of u's,
a first year would be better.

00:06:27.971 --> 00:06:30.348
- Then Maki-chan's a better choice.
- What?

00:06:30.348 --> 00:06:33.851
She's good at singing, and she seems
more like a leader. I choose Maki-chan.

00:06:34.686 --> 00:06:35.395
Rin.

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:37.271
Weren't you listening?

00:06:37.271 --> 00:06:39.107
Everyone thinks you should do it.

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.193
But ...

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.569
You don't want to?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.571
It's not that.

00:06:45.571 --> 00:06:47.865
I'm just not good at that kind of thing.

00:06:48.533 --> 00:06:49.951
How surprising.

00:06:49.951 --> 00:06:53.037
I thought you'd happily accept the job.

00:06:53.037 --> 00:06:56.374
Rin-chan can be pretty shy.

00:06:56.708 --> 00:06:59.460
Especially when it comes to herself.

00:06:59.836 --> 00:07:00.586
Rin...

00:07:03.172 --> 00:07:06.050
I understand that you're hesitant
over this sudden decision,

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.678
but everyone thinks you're the best fit.

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:12.765
Why don't you try believing that sentiment?

00:07:12.765 --> 00:07:14.100
But...

00:07:21.816 --> 00:07:25.111
Fine. If you insist.

00:07:27.196 --> 00:07:28.364
Rin-chan!

00:07:28.948 --> 00:07:31.951
Well, it looks like it's going
to stop raining soon.

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:33.244
Start your after-school training.

00:07:36.539 --> 00:07:37.832
Uh, um...

00:07:37.832 --> 00:07:41.085
I would like to begin practice now.

00:07:42.628 --> 00:07:44.547
That's nothing to clap about.

00:07:45.882 --> 00:07:48.134
Um... Let us start by...

00:07:48.134 --> 00:07:51.012
L-Let us begin with proper stretching.

00:07:51.012 --> 00:07:53.139
Please spread out, everyone.

00:07:55.808 --> 00:07:59.479
When that has concluded, we shall
proceed to warming up our voices.

00:07:59.937 --> 00:08:00.980
What are you doing?

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.273
Rin-chan.

00:08:02.273 --> 00:08:03.858
Oh? What is the matter?

00:08:03.858 --> 00:08:05.651
Why are you talking like that?

00:08:05.651 --> 00:08:07.528
Huh? What?

00:08:07.528 --> 00:08:09.572
Did I say something weird?

00:08:10.406 --> 00:08:13.576
You don't need to be so formal
just because you're the leader.

00:08:13.951 --> 00:08:15.369
Act normally.

00:08:15.369 --> 00:08:16.746
O-Oh, right.

00:08:17.371 --> 00:08:19.207
Um, in that case...

00:08:19.207 --> 00:08:22.710
Let's get to stretching!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:27.924
Jeez, this isn't the time for games.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.220
Hey, are you a little nervous?

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.846
More than a little.

00:08:33.846 --> 00:08:36.474
One, two, three, four.

00:08:36.474 --> 00:08:38.392
- One, two, three...
- Rin, you're offbeat.

00:08:45.233 --> 00:08:49.445
Hey, I think it'd be best if we backed up here.

00:08:49.445 --> 00:08:51.280
What are you saying? It's the opposite.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:55.284
Considering how big the stage is, we
should move forward to stand out more.

00:08:55.284 --> 00:08:59.747
That's why we should back up
and use the full size of the stage.

00:08:59.747 --> 00:09:02.750
No, we should definitely move forward.

00:09:03.417 --> 00:09:06.629
C-Calm down, you two.

00:09:08.422 --> 00:09:10.258
Oh, yeah. What do you think, Rin?

00:09:10.258 --> 00:09:10.800
What?

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.218
Yeah, Leader.

00:09:12.218 --> 00:09:13.177
Rin-chan.

00:09:13.177 --> 00:09:15.346
Huh? Uh...

00:09:15.346 --> 00:09:17.890
Maybe we should ask Honoka-chan...

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:20.143
Then we'll never be ready in time.

00:09:21.644 --> 00:09:23.354
Then we'll ask Eli-chan.

00:09:23.354 --> 00:09:24.772
- Rin.
-Yes?

00:09:24.772 --> 00:09:27.441
You're the leader. You decide.

00:09:28.609 --> 00:09:30.361
R-Right.

00:09:30.361 --> 00:09:31.779
Um...

00:09:36.409 --> 00:09:39.704
I'll figure it out by tomorrow.

00:09:44.375 --> 00:09:46.085
I'm exhausted...

00:09:46.085 --> 00:09:49.380
It's impossible for me to be the leader.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:52.967
That's not true. You'll get used to it.

00:09:52.967 --> 00:09:55.011
Yeah. It's only your first day.

00:09:55.011 --> 00:10:01.100
Sure, you say that, but you made me be the
leader because you didn't want to do it.

00:10:01.517 --> 00:10:02.852
What are you talking about?

00:10:02.852 --> 00:10:06.022
I recommended you because I really
think you'll make a good leader.

00:10:06.022 --> 00:10:10.568
That's right. Even if Honoka-chan and the
others had recommended someone else,

00:10:10.568 --> 00:10:12.904
I still would've suggested you.

00:10:13.321 --> 00:10:15.448
What? No way.

00:10:15.448 --> 00:10:18.826
After all, I'm definitely not fit to be a leader.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:20.328
Why not?

00:10:20.328 --> 00:10:21.829
Because...

00:10:21.829 --> 00:10:26.000
You know, I'm not the type
to stand in the center.

00:10:26.709 --> 00:10:28.169
Ouch...

00:10:28.169 --> 00:10:29.128
Maki-chan?

00:10:29.128 --> 00:10:32.298
Is that really how you think of yourself?

00:10:32.632 --> 00:10:33.799
She's right!

00:10:33.799 --> 00:10:38.262
In y's, we don't have a center.
Everyone in the group is the same.

00:10:39.805 --> 00:10:41.724
I know that...

00:10:42.642 --> 00:10:43.976
But...

00:10:45.186 --> 00:10:47.021
I'm different.

00:10:47.021 --> 00:10:50.066
I'm nothing like an idol.

00:10:50.066 --> 00:10:53.110
I'm even less like an idol.

00:10:53.444 --> 00:10:55.071
That's not true.

00:10:55.071 --> 00:10:58.866
You're cute and girly.

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:02.370
What? You're cuter!

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.413
That's not true!

00:11:05.748 --> 00:11:11.337
All but the most conceited people think that
everyone else is cuter than themselves.

00:11:11.337 --> 00:11:13.881
No, I'm different!

00:11:15.883 --> 00:11:16.842
Rin...

00:11:17.551 --> 00:11:18.970
I accepted the responsibility.

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:22.640
I'll be the leader until
Honoka-chan comes back.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:26.269
But I'm definitely not fit for it.

00:11:26.269 --> 00:11:27.353
Rin-chan!

00:11:29.897 --> 00:11:32.608
Is the past still bothering her?

00:11:32.608 --> 00:11:33.442
What?

00:11:33.442 --> 00:11:38.990
In elementary school, kids always
told her she was like a boy.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:42.368
They would make fun of her
when she wore skirts.

00:11:44.453 --> 00:11:47.915
I thought it didn't bother her anymore.

00:11:48.541 --> 00:11:52.586
Now that you mention it, I've never seen
her wear a skirt outside of her uniform...

00:12:04.223 --> 00:12:05.599
Love Live!

00:12:08.102 --> 00:12:08.853
This time...

00:12:09.478 --> 00:12:10.813
I'll win this time!

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.315
Um...

00:12:14.358 --> 00:12:15.735
Is it this one?

00:12:17.695 --> 00:12:18.612
There!

00:12:18.612 --> 00:12:20.948
All right! I'm out!

00:12:20.948 --> 00:12:21.657
Yay!

00:12:22.199 --> 00:12:23.784
Why do I always lose?

00:12:24.618 --> 00:12:27.330
Maybe we should go to sleep soon.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.291
Do you have a minute?

00:12:31.208 --> 00:12:32.376
What's wrong?

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:35.379
What!? They can't come home!?

00:12:35.755 --> 00:12:38.716
That's right. Their flight was canceled.

00:12:38.716 --> 00:12:41.177
Then what about the fashion show?

00:12:41.177 --> 00:12:44.096
Unfortunately, the six of us will have to do it.

00:12:44.513 --> 00:12:45.931
This is sudden.

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:47.641
But we have to do it.

00:12:48.017 --> 00:12:51.645
Idols always put on the best
performance possible.

00:12:51.645 --> 00:12:52.688
Nico!

00:12:52.688 --> 00:12:54.065
You're right.

00:12:54.065 --> 00:12:56.442
About the center...

00:12:57.443 --> 00:12:58.110
Huh?

00:13:06.327 --> 00:13:07.244
No way...

00:13:07.244 --> 00:13:12.208
Because it's a fashion show,
the center will be wearing this outfit.

00:13:12.208 --> 00:13:13.292
It's beautiful!

00:13:13.292 --> 00:13:15.169
Won! Der! Ful!

00:13:15.169 --> 00:13:17.922
It's every girl's dream.

00:13:17.922 --> 00:13:21.217
You want me to wear that while singing?

00:13:21.217 --> 00:13:24.095
While Honoka's not here, you're the leader.

00:13:25.054 --> 00:13:27.723
Y-You want me to wear that?

00:13:30.226 --> 00:13:31.769
Why are you laughing?

00:13:33.312 --> 00:13:34.605
Did Rin just snap?

00:13:34.605 --> 00:13:36.065
Ugh, do something!

00:13:36.816 --> 00:13:38.150
Wild Okinawan sweets!

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:39.151
Where?

00:13:39.151 --> 00:13:39.985
Rin-chan!

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:41.570
Wha—!?

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.447
It's locked! Why?

00:13:43.447 --> 00:13:45.950
- Why do you think?
- I-1 don't know.

00:13:46.409 --> 00:13:50.871
Because you're always trying to catch me!

00:13:53.707 --> 00:13:54.917
Wait!

00:13:54.917 --> 00:13:58.045
I can't. There's no way it
would look good on me.

00:13:58.045 --> 00:13:59.588
That's not true.

00:13:59.588 --> 00:14:01.173
It is true!

00:14:01.173 --> 00:14:05.052
Look at how short my hair is.

00:14:05.052 --> 00:14:09.056
There are plenty of brides with short hair.

00:14:09.056 --> 00:14:14.061
That's not what I meant. I wouldn't
look good in such girly clothes.

00:14:14.061 --> 00:14:17.314
Even if you don't normally,
you wear skirts onstage all the time.

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:21.861
That's because we're all wearing the same
clothes, and I'm on the edge of the group.

00:14:21.861 --> 00:14:25.406
For the sake of J's, it's better if it's not me.

00:14:26.949 --> 00:14:31.287
But the outfit was made for Honoka-chan.

00:14:31.287 --> 00:14:33.747
If Rin-chan's going to wear
it, we'll have to get it fitted.

00:14:33.747 --> 00:14:37.543
Yeah, yeah! It shouldn't be me...right?

00:14:37.543 --> 00:14:40.713
The closest person to Honoka-chan is...

00:14:41.464 --> 00:14:42.715
Hanayo-chan?

00:14:42.715 --> 00:14:43.674
Me?

00:14:43.674 --> 00:14:47.595
Yeah! You're so good at
singing, you'd be perfect!

00:14:47.595 --> 00:14:48.345
What?

00:14:48.345 --> 00:14:55.519
I do feel like we've been putting too much
on Rin by suddenly making her the leader.

00:14:55.519 --> 00:14:56.770
Hanayo, what do you think?

00:14:57.188 --> 00:14:58.481
I

00:14:58.481 --> 00:15:00.107
You should do it!

00:15:00.107 --> 00:15:02.860
You're so cute, Kayo-chin.
You'd make a perfect center.

00:15:04.069 --> 00:15:04.653
But...

00:15:05.905 --> 00:15:07.990
Rin-chan, are you sure?

00:15:09.283 --> 00:15:10.659
Of course I am.

00:15:11.327 --> 00:15:12.369
Really?

00:15:13.621 --> 00:15:14.330
Of course.

00:15:14.872 --> 00:15:15.831
Rin...

00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:18.584
It's decided, then.

00:15:18.584 --> 00:15:20.419
Huh? But—

00:15:20.419 --> 00:15:21.879
Yep, yep.

00:15:23.422 --> 00:15:24.298
The weather?

00:15:25.049 --> 00:15:26.926
It hasn't changed.

00:15:26.926 --> 00:15:29.512
Anyway, will you be okay for the event?

00:15:29.512 --> 00:15:32.932
Yes. Hanayo is going to be our center.

00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:34.266
Hanayo-chan?

00:15:36.143 --> 00:15:36.769
I see.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:38.646
Is something wrong?

00:15:38.646 --> 00:15:41.232
Oh, no. Good luck!

00:15:46.737 --> 00:15:48.739
Kayo-chin, you're so pretty.

00:15:48.739 --> 00:15:50.533
R-Really?

00:15:50.533 --> 00:15:54.036
Yeah, it looks best on you.

00:15:54.036 --> 00:15:56.747
You can do it. You have my support!

00:15:56.747 --> 00:15:58.249
You're going to be singing, too.

00:15:58.249 --> 00:15:59.208
Oh, right.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.503
As we expected, it's a perfect fit.

00:16:02.503 --> 00:16:06.173
We might want to take in the sides.

00:16:06.173 --> 00:16:09.468
We'll take care of the rest.
You girls go practice.

00:16:09.468 --> 00:16:12.555
Got it. Let's go!

00:16:12.555 --> 00:16:14.723
Where did all this energy come from?

00:16:14.723 --> 00:16:16.600
I always have lots of energy.

00:16:17.101 --> 00:16:19.270
- Shall we get to it?
- Yeah.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.105
I'm going to touch you here.

00:16:21.105 --> 00:16:21.772
Okay.

00:16:21.772 --> 00:16:23.357
Like this?

00:16:23.357 --> 00:16:24.817
Maybe a little more.

00:16:25.317 --> 00:16:26.360
Right.

00:16:27.903 --> 00:16:29.780
We can take this in a little more.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:30.531
Yeah.

00:16:32.408 --> 00:16:33.325
Rin-chan...

00:16:54.221 --> 00:16:57.558
Just as I thought, it doesn't suit me.

00:16:58.225 --> 00:17:00.644
So that's why I'm doing it.

00:17:00.644 --> 00:17:02.021
I see.

00:17:02.021 --> 00:17:05.316
Sorry for calling you out of the
blue. It was bothering me.

00:17:05.316 --> 00:17:08.736
It's okay. I wanted to talk to you, too.

00:17:08.736 --> 00:17:11.405
So, what are you going to do now?

00:17:12.364 --> 00:17:14.116
I'm not sure.

00:17:14.575 --> 00:17:18.329
Maki-chan also asked me if
we were doing the right thing.

00:17:18.829 --> 00:17:22.082
But Rin-chan seems distressed.

00:17:22.082 --> 00:17:24.918
I felt bad about forcing her to do it.

00:17:24.918 --> 00:17:26.253
I see.

00:17:26.253 --> 00:17:28.422
What would you do?

00:17:28.422 --> 00:17:30.132
Huh? Me?

00:17:32.926 --> 00:17:34.845
You have to decide for yourself.

00:17:34.845 --> 00:17:35.929
Huh?

00:17:35.929 --> 00:17:38.891
Yeah. You have to decide.

00:17:47.775 --> 00:17:49.193
Wow!

00:17:49.193 --> 00:17:51.028
Models are amazing.

00:17:51.028 --> 00:17:52.237
Y-Yeah.

00:17:52.237 --> 00:17:55.032
Rin-chan, we need to get ready.

00:17:55.032 --> 00:17:56.116
Oh, yeah.

00:17:56.116 --> 00:17:57.576
Okay, girls.

00:17:57.576 --> 00:18:00.871
Let's get changed and practice
our choreography one last time.

00:18:00.871 --> 00:18:01.455
Okay.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.624
Rin-chan, your outfit's over there.

00:18:03.624 --> 00:18:04.583
Got it!

00:18:09.171 --> 00:18:11.799
Huh? What?

00:18:11.799 --> 00:18:13.133
Kayo-chin, this isn't...

00:18:13.926 --> 00:18:15.386
It is yours.

00:18:15.386 --> 00:18:17.471
You're wearing that outfit, Rin.

00:18:17.471 --> 00:18:19.306
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:18:19.306 --> 00:18:21.475
I thought we decided that Kayo-chin
was going to be the center.

00:18:21.475 --> 00:18:23.477
That's how we've been practicing.

00:18:23.477 --> 00:18:24.520
It's okay.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:29.942
We prepared for having you
as our center this morning.

00:18:29.942 --> 00:18:31.610
N-No way.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.986
Stop joking around.

00:18:32.986 --> 00:18:34.738
Do you think we're joking?

00:18:36.365 --> 00:18:37.908
B-But...

00:18:37.908 --> 00:18:42.413
Rin-chan, I thought about how you felt,

00:18:42.413 --> 00:18:46.125
and I accepted the position because
I knew it made you uncomfortable.

00:18:46.125 --> 00:18:51.046
But then I remembered when I joined U's.

00:18:52.047 --> 00:18:54.007
Now it's my turn.

00:18:54.591 --> 00:18:57.678
Rin-chan... Rin-chan, you're cute.

00:18:57.678 --> 00:18:58.262
What?

00:18:58.262 --> 00:19:00.389
Everyone said so.

00:19:00.389 --> 00:19:04.268
You might be the girliest one in the group.

00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:05.853
Th-That's not—

00:19:05.853 --> 00:19:07.271
It is true!

00:19:07.271 --> 00:19:09.982
After all, I think you're cute!

00:19:09.982 --> 00:19:13.527
You're so cute, I want to hold you!

00:19:16.196 --> 00:19:18.198
I understand how you feel.

00:19:18.657 --> 00:19:20.784
Just look at that outfit.

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:25.873
It suits you the best, Rin.

00:19:50.022 --> 00:19:52.149
N-Nice to meet you.

00:19:52.149 --> 00:19:55.319
We're Otonokizaka High's
school idol group, u's.

00:19:55.319 --> 00:19:56.820
So cute!

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:58.197
She's beautiful!

00:19:58.197 --> 00:19:59.698
Oh... Um...

00:20:00.866 --> 00:20:02.159
Khorosho.

00:20:02.159 --> 00:20:03.368
You look so cute.

00:20:03.744 --> 00:20:06.330
Th-Thank you very much.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.875
Um... We usually have nine members.

00:20:10.417 --> 00:20:13.712
Due to circumstances, only the
six of us will be singing today.

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:19.676
But we'll be singing our hearts
out for the other three.

00:20:20.177 --> 00:20:25.390
And now, please watch our cutest selves!

00:20:40.155 --> 00:20:47.496
Akogare no shunkan wo mukaeru toki ga kitayo The time
has come to meet the moment I've been waiting for

00:20:47.496 --> 00:20:54.795
iinokana konnanimo shiawase kanjiteruyo
Is it right for me to feel so much happiness?

00:20:54.795 --> 00:21:01.885
Hikari ni sasowarete arukidasu kono michi wa
Beckoned by the light, I walk this path

00:21:01.885 --> 00:21:09.434
mirai e to tsuzuiteru kibou ni michiterune
Leads to the future and is full of hope

00:21:10.686 --> 00:21:18.235
daredemo kawaiku nareru Kitto nareruyo
Anyone can be cute? I'm sure anyone can

00:21:18.235 --> 00:21:25.450
konna watashi desae mo henshin
Even I can...transform!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:32.207
Dakarane ageruyo genki sonomama no egao
de So I'll give you energy, with that smile

00:21:32.207 --> 00:21:35.961
utaou utaou ageruyo genki
Let's sing, let's sing, I'll give you energy

00:21:35.961 --> 00:21:39.882
nayamanaide yume wo miyou
Let's not worry and dream

00:21:39.882 --> 00:21:46.555
daisukina minna to naraba atarashii koto dekiru As long as
we're with the people we love, we can accomplish new things

00:21:46.555 --> 00:21:52.144
umarekawarou korekara motto hirogaru hazu Let's
be reborn, our world will continue to grow

00:21:52.144 --> 00:21:57.316
saa ashita ga mietekuru
Come, I can see tomorrow

00:21:57.316 --> 00:22:01.904
LOVE WING LOVE WING
LOVE WING... LOVE WING...

00:22:09.244 --> 00:22:11.121
All right!

00:22:11.121 --> 00:22:15.125
It's practice time!

00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:20.923
Ureshiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou
Because I'm happy, I'll go see you

00:22:20.923 --> 00:22:26.637
sabishiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou (ai ni ikuyo)
Because I'm lonely, I'll go see you (I'll go see you)

00:22:27.054 --> 00:22:29.932
Sonna kimochi ni narunda
That's how I feel

00:22:29.932 --> 00:22:32.893
susumu toki nayamu toki Whether I'm
making progress or hung up on something,

00:22:32.893 --> 00:22:36.897
tsunagatteirundane zutto
We're always connected

00:22:38.398 --> 00:22:44.029
<i>honki no yume de (HI LETS GO) asu wo tsukamu (HI GO GO) With
a true dream, (Hi! Let's go') seize tomorrow (Hi' Go, go')</i>

00:22:44.029 --> 00:22:51.495
Kitto dekiruyo kimi nara
I'm sure you can do it

00:22:53.914 --> 00:22:59.753
tama ni wa yukkuri kimi no pehsu de
Sometimes, take your time at your own pace

00:22:59.753 --> 00:23:05.592
yaritai kototachi mitsumetegoran
To look at all the things you want to do

00:23:05.592 --> 00:23:12.641
sono ato ganbare zenryokudene (ganbarouyo) Then do
your best! With all your strength (Let's do our best)

00:23:12.641 --> 00:23:21.692
Kibun ga harete ohzora e maiagaruyo Once you've
cleared your head, you'll fly up into the sky

00:23:22.234 --> 00:23:32.619
donna toki datte kimi wo mitsumeteru
I'm always looking at you

00:23:35.872 --> 00:23:39.167
Next time on Love Live!
"Happy Halloween"
